#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:4
msgid "Using FFmpeg with OpenToonz"
msgstr "在OpenToonz中使用FFmpeg"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:7
msgid "What is FFmpeg?"
msgstr "什么是FFmpeg"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:8
msgid ""
"To render your animation as an **mp4** or **webm**, or also as a **gif** on "
"Mac, OpenToonz requires the FFmpeg multimedia framework to be installed on your "
"machine."
msgstr ""
"要在Mac上将动画渲染为**mp4**或**webm**，或同时渲染为**gif**，OpenToonz需要在您的"
"计算机上安装FFmpeg多媒体框架。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:9
msgid ""
"For more information, please visit this page: `About FFmpeg <https://www.ffmpeg."
"org/about.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"有关更多信息，请访问此页面：`关于FFmpeg<https://www.ffmpeg.org/about.html>`_"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:12
msgid "Installing FFmpeg for Windows"
msgstr "安装适用于Windows的FFmpeg"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:15
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:62
msgid "Downloading"
msgstr "下载"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:17
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:64
msgid ""
"To download FFmpeg, first visit this page: `Download FFmpeg <https://www.ffmpeg."
"org/download.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"要下载FFmpeg，请首先访问此页面：`下载FFmpeg<https://www.ffmpeg.org/download."
"html>`_"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:19
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:66
msgid "|get_the_packages|"
msgstr "|get_the_packages|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:21
msgid "Select the Windows icon and then select the **Windows builds** link:"
msgstr "选择Windows图标，然后选择**Windows构建**链接："

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:23
msgid "|packages_windows|"
msgstr "|软件包_windows|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:25
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:72
msgid ""
"You will be taken to an **FFmpeg Builds** page with some options for the "
"version of FFmpeg that you want to download:"
msgstr "您将被带到**FFmpeg Builds**页面，其中包含要下载的FFmpeg版本的一些选项："

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:27
msgid "|ffmpeg_builds_windows|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_builds_windows|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:29
msgid "In the majority of cases, the default choices are fine."
msgstr "在大多数情况下，默认选项是可以的。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:30
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:78
msgid ""
"Click on the blue **Download Build** button, this will begin downloading a zip "
"archive containing FFmpeg."
msgstr "点击蓝色**下载构建**按钮，这将开始下载包含FFmpeg的zip存档。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:33
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:81
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:35
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:83
msgid ""
"Once you have downloaded the FFmpeg zip archive, open it and double-click on "
"the first folder."
msgstr "下载FFmpeg zip存档后，打开它并双击第一个文件夹。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:37
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:85
msgid "Within the **bin** folder are the executable files that you will need."
msgstr "**bin**文件夹中是您需要的可执行文件。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:39
msgid ""
"Create a new folder on your computer, the recommended location is **C:\\\\**."
msgstr "在您的计算机上创建一个新文件夹，建议位置为**C:\\\\**。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:40
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:91
msgid "Name the new folder **FFmpeg**."
msgstr "将新文件夹命名为**FFmpeg**。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:41
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:92
msgid ""
"Drag the contents of the **bin** folder from the archive into the newly created "
"folder."
msgstr "将**bin**文件夹的内容从存档拖动到新创建的文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:43
msgid "|ffmpeg_extracted_windows|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_extracted_windows|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:45
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:99
msgid ""
"Next, start OpenToonz and open the **Preferences** window with File  →  "
"**Preferences...**"
msgstr "接下来，启动OpenToonz并使用文件打开**首选项**窗口→  **偏好。..**"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:46
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:100
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:130
msgid ""
"Navigate to the **Import/Export** category; at the top you will see a box with "
"the text **FFmpeg path**."
msgstr "导航到**导入/导出**类别；在顶部，您将看到一个文本框**FFmpeg路径**。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:47
msgid ""
"Insert the path to your FFmpeg folder that you created earlier, if you have "
"used the recommended path, this will be **C:\\\\FFmpeg\\\\**:"
msgstr ""
"插入您之前创建的FFmpeg文件夹的路径，如果您使用了推荐的路径，这将是**C:\\\\FFmpeg"
"\\\\**："

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:49
msgid "|ffmpeg_path_windows|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_path_windows|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:51
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:105
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:135
msgid "Restart OpenToonz."
msgstr "重新启动OpenToonz"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:52
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:106
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:136
msgid "Open the **Output Settings** window with Render  →  **Output Settings...**"
msgstr "使用Render打开**输出设置**窗口→  **输出设置。..**"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:54
msgid ""
"In the **File Settings** subsection, you should now see **mp4** and **webm**."
msgstr "在**文件设置**小节中，您现在应该看到**mp4**和**webm**。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:56
msgid "|output_settings_windows|"
msgstr "|输出设置窗口|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:59
msgid "Installing FFmpeg for Mac"
msgstr "安装适用于Mac的FFmpeg"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:68
msgid "Select the Apple icon and select the **Static and Shared builds** link."
msgstr "选择Apple图标，然后选择**静态和共享构建**链接。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:70
msgid "|packages_mac|"
msgstr "|packages_mac|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:74
msgid "Make sure **macOS 64-bit** is selected under the **Architecture** column."
msgstr "Make sure **macOS 64-bit** is selected under the **Architecture** column."

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:76
msgid "|ffmpeg_builds_mac|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_builds_mac|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:87
msgid ""
"Open Finder and create a new folder, the **Applications/OpenToonz** folder is "
"the recommended location."
msgstr ""
"打开Finder并创建一个新文件夹，**Applications/OpenToonz**文件夹是推荐的位置。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:89
msgid "|ffmpeg_finder|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_finder|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:94
msgid "|ffmpeg_extracted_mac|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_extracted_mac|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:96
msgid ""
"For macOS 10.15 and later, each executable within the FFmpeg folder needs to be "
"opened before using OpenToonz (this only needs to be done one time, due to "
"security features). In Finder, right-click on each executable (ffmpeg, ffprobe, "
"and etc.) and select ``Open With → Terminal``. Once the Terminal windows have "
"launched successfully, Terminal can be closed."
msgstr ""
"对于macOS 10.15及更高版本，在使用OpenToonz之前，需要打开FFmpeg文件夹中的每个可执"
"行文件（由于安全功能，这只需要打开一次）。在Finder中，右键单击每个可执行文件"
"（ffmpeg、ffprobe等），然后选择“打开方式”→ 终端“”。终端窗口成功启动后，可以关闭"
"终端。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:101
msgid ""
"Insert the path to your FFmpeg folder that you created earlier, if you have "
"used the recommended path, this will be **/Applications/OpenToonz/FFmpeg**:"
msgstr ""
"Insert the path to your FFmpeg folder that you created earlier, if you have "
"used the recommended path, this will be **/Applications/OpenToonz/FFmpeg**:"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:103
msgid "|ffmpeg_path_mac|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_path_mac|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:108
#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:138
msgid ""
"In the **File Settings** subsection, you should now see **mp4**, **webm** and "
"**gif**."
msgstr "在**文件设置**小节中，您现在应该看到**mp4**、**webm**和**gif**。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:110
msgid "|output_settings_mac|"
msgstr "|output_settings_mac|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:113
msgid "Installing FFmpeg for Linux"
msgstr "安装Linux版FFmpeg"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:115
msgid ""
"To install FFmpeg, enter the following command in the shell depending on your "
"distribution."
msgstr "要安装FFmpeg，请根据您的发行版在shell中输入以下命令。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:117
msgid "Arch Linux: ``# pacman -S extra/ffmpeg``"
msgstr "Arch Linux: ``# pacman -S extra/ffmpeg``"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:119
msgid "Debian GNU/Linux: ``# apt install ffmpeg``"
msgstr "Debian GNU/Linux: ``# apt install ffmpeg``"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:121
msgid "Gentoo Linux: ``# emerge media-video/ffmpeg``"
msgstr "Gentoo Linux: ``# emerge media-video/ffmpeg``"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:123
msgid "Solus: ``# eopkg install ffmpeg``"
msgstr "Solus: ``# eopkg install ffmpeg``"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:125
msgid ""
"If you are using a other Linux distribution please refer to its documentation "
"or visit the `FFmpeg website <https://www.ffmpeg.org/download.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"如果您使用的是其他Linux发行版，请参阅其文档或访问“FFmpeg网站”<https://www."
"ffmpeg.org/download.html>`_."

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:127
msgid ""
"To make it possible to export files in **mp4**, **webm** or **gif** formats, "
"you need to specify the path to FFmpeg installed on your system, usually it is "
"**/usr/bin/ffmpeg**. Enter command ``which ffmpeg`` in the shell to find out."
msgstr ""
"要导出**mp4**、**webm**或**gif**格式的文件，您需要指定系统上安装的FFmpeg的路径，"
"通常是**/usr/bin/FFmpeg**。在shell中输入命令“which ffmpeg”以查找。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:129
msgid ""
"Start OpenToonz and open the **Preferences** window with File  →  "
"**Preferences...**"
msgstr "启动OpenToonz并使用文件打开**首选项**窗口→  **偏好。..**"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:131
msgid "Insert the path **/usr/bin**."
msgstr "插入路径**/usr/bin**。"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:133
msgid "|ffmpeg_path_linux|"
msgstr "|ffmpeg_path_linux|"

#: ../../source/using_ffmpeg_with_opentoonz.rst:140
msgid "|output_settings_linux|"
msgstr "|output_settings_linux|"
